1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
I just never thought

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
that being weak and powerless

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
could be so frustrating.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
[Killua] Gon…

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
for the 30 days that you can't use Nen,

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
[opening theme music playing]

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000
[singer singing in English]

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

9
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
[singer singing in English]

10
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

11
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
ONE WISH X AND X TWO PROMISES

12
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
to ask the Hunters for a favor.

13
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:15,000
His desperate wish
was that they save the dying queen.

14
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:28,000
[Netero] It's me. I want you to send over
the Chimera Ant research team immediately.

15
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Contact Dr. Lee
of the Fanlin Medical College.

16
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Have her assemble a team
of the best surgeons

17
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:43,000
and artificial organ engineering
specialists she can find.

18
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
-Hmm.
-[line disconnects]

19
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Be ready to leave here in four hours.

20
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,000
[Morel and Knov] Yes, sir.

21
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,000
[both gasp]

22
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:04,000
[Netero] We will do
absolutely everything in our power.

23
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,000
And, Colt…

24
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,000
We're going to need your help
to accomplish this.

25
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,000
[grunts]

26
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:29,000
It is. His "heart" T-shirt.

27
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,000
[breathing deeply]

28
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,000
[Knov] I thought it was just a rumor.

29
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:57,000
your opinion on this matter
would be rather helpful,

30
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:08,000
It feels like little needles
stabbing all over my body.

31
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,000
I doubt…

32
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,000
that you'll be able
to lay a finger on him.

33
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
-[Morel] Huh?
-[Knov] Hmm?

34
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,000
[Colt] You'll be killed
by one of his Royal Guards

35
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
before you can even get close.

36
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Now, Morel,

37
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:44,000
the pupils will be decided today, correct?

38
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,000
[Morel] Right.

39
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,000
Go with Colt and gather the victors
and research team together.

40
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Then quickly get everyone
over to the nest.

41
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:54,000
And you, sir?
You can't pursue the King alone.

42
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Don't forget my million, okay?

43
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,000
Oh, you'll get your money.

44
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
[Bihorn] Everyone else has already left.

45
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,000
[Panda Ant] Sure looks that way.

46
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:38,000
Most of our soldiers went off
and joined one of the other squads,

47
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:41,000
except for a handful
of oddballs that defected.

48
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,000
They all decided to stay here.

49
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,000
[instruments clattering]

50
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:53,000
Update me.
Were you the one who stopped the bleeding?

51
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:06,000
For the moment, we'll attach
as many artificial organs as we can.

52
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Can you use my organs?
You can have all of my blood as well.

53
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:19,000
Chimera Ants from different generations
are completely different organisms.

54
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
Just look around you.

55
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:24,000
You'll see how much the Chimera Ants
in your own generation vary.

56
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,000
[grunts]

57
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,000
[Dr. Lee] Thank you nonetheless.

58
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,000
We promise to do our best.

59
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,000
[Queen] Is anyone there?

60
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:23,000
[Colt] Yes! I'm right by your side.
Is there anything you need?

61
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
[Morel] What is it?

62
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
-[Dr. Lee] A signal?
-[Octopus Ant] Correct.

63
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:31,000
The Queen is not capable of speech
like the rest of us are.

64
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,000
Can you interpret for me?

65
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:36,000
She may give us a hint
as to how to save her life.

66
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,000
[Queen] Tell me…

67
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
My son, how is he?

68
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Is he all right?

69
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,000
"Anything at all?"

70
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,000
[Colt groans]

71
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,000
[Colt] Don't worry.

72
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:01,000
He is perfectly healthy, and right now…

73
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Right now he's taken the Royal Guard
to look for herbs,

74
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:15,000
The truth is that after he killed
and ate some of the squad leaders,

75
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,000
he left to find a new territory.

76
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,000
[Knuckle] Huh?

77
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
[Queen] Then he's safe?

78
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,000
The King is safe?

79
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:35,000
[Colt] Yes.

80
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,000
[Queen sighs]

81
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:20,000
However, it appears that
I have finally fulfilled my destiny.

82
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,000
That's enough for me.

83
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,000
[Colt] What are you saying?

84
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:46,000
[Queen] I know my body
better than anyone else,

85
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:04,000
Even so, I have no regrets, not one.

86
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,000
[Colt] Please stop.

87
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,000
My queen, you have to live!

88
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:13,000
Use my body. It's the only way.

89
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,000
Come on! You have to try, at least.

90
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Listen to her.

91
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,000
Respect her wishes. They may be her last.

92
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
[gasps]

93
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:30,000
[Queen] I have one final request.

94
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
A name?

95
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Meruem.

96
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,000
him know.

97
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,000
[gasping]

98
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:20,000
[flatline tone ringing]

99
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:35,000
I failed to protect her again.

100
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,000
I'm useless.

101
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,000
I can't protect anyone.

102
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:56,000
[Panda Ant] No, he's probably referring
to a memory from when he was human.

103
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,000
If you've ever wondered
how we learned to talk so fast,

104
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,000
that's how.

105
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,000
[Morel sighs]

106
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,000
[gasps softly]

107
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:44,000
[gasps]

108
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,000
[Octopus Ant] Look!

109
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:49,000
There's something moving!

110
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,000
[Colt] Don't.

111
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:57,000
Stand back. I'll get it myself.

112
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,000
[gasps]

113
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,000
[crying]

114
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,000
this baby.

115
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,000
I swear it.

116
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,000
[Knov] Morel?

117
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:23,000
Colt, can you promise me
that neither of you will ever eat a human?

118
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:40,000
But if you're willing
to give me your word…

119
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:50,000
I won't let anyone harm you two,
not as long as I'm around anyway.

120
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,000
[chuckles]

121
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
There's no doubt about it.

122
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,000
[screaming]

123
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,000
Right. I'm over it now.

124
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:16,000
Knuckle and the other Hunters
are gonna save Kite, I'm sure of it.

125
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:19,000
So I have to get a whole lot stronger,

126
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:37,000
but the fact remains that we've spent
much more time with him than you have.

127
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
[gasps]

128
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:49,000
Then I'd tell you Kite wouldn't want
to see you two like this.

129
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,000
I'm positive that he's still alive,

130
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:56,000
and I'm absolutely certain he wouldn't
want the two of you to have any regrets.

131
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:59,000
The question is what to do now.

132
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:03,000
You should choose wisely
and find the will to follow through.

133
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,000
Yeah. You're right.

134
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:39,000
It's a species of bird
that only live around a certain mine.

135
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:44,000
No one's been able to figure out
exactly why that is yet.

136
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,000
The food, the water, the weather,
nothing really explains it.

137
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:52,000
So we bought the entire area
where the mine is located.

138
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:58,000
Or rather, where what's left of it is.

139
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,000
Kite financed it for us.

140
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:06,000
We were just kids
who had nothing to offer in return,

141
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:37,000
taking flight
with the light of dawn at their backs.

142
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:41,000
It's the most vivid and lasting memory
Stick and I have.

143
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:50,000
When we found out the area was
slated to become an industrial waste site,

144
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:54,000
we finally realized
how important all of it was to us.

145
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:17,000
To my treasure.

146
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:29,000
[footsteps approaching]

147
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:36,000
[both grunt]

148
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:40,000
[scraping, fluttering echoing]

149
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:11,000
[scraping, fluttering]

150
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,000
[gasps]

151
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,000
[groans]

152
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:39,000
I truly am the king of speed.

153
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:53,000
Given Cheetu's speed, it's a good bet
that he's already crossed the border.

154
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Cows, pigs, humans, boars, bears.

155
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:13,000
I don't even care,
as long as they're plentiful.

156
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Because I'm the king, the king of eaters.

157
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:30,000
in order to become kings themselves.

158
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[closing theme music playing]

159
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

160
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:31,000
[upbeat music playing]

161
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,000
[Gon] Next time, "Date with Palm."

162
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
